  "description": "After being rejected by her unrequited love, the usually carefree Narae decides she needs to redeem her self-esteem. A normal girl by day, at night Narae now transforms into \"BJ Nari,\" the cosplaying livestreamer! It doesn’t matter that she got rejected, she’ll show her adoring fans how sexy she is! Things start heating up when a mysterious user named “Aooya” proposes something naughty to Narae on her livestream. Hesitant at first, she’s a true exhibitionist at heart and gives her fans what they want. As she gets deeper and deeper into the world of live streaming, will Narae be able to resist the temptations that await her?\n\n(Source: Lezhin X)",
